"},"reviews":[{"reviewbody":"OK, It's dated, But this short is still fantastic. Some of the later Popeye shorts are bland, But this one is great, Featuring fun jokes, delightful animation and other stuff. Plus, It's complete with orginal \"Paramount Pictures\" logo, instead of the damn AAP logo. Worth downloading!","reviewtitle":"Fabulous!","reviewer":"Robin_1990","reviewdate":"2008-02-16 10:43:27","createdate":"2008-02-16 10:43:27","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Popeye and Bluto are both running for president. They are tied with exactly the same number of votes, but Miss Olive Oyl has yet to cast her ballot. Which candidate will be able to impress her the most and earn her precious vote?OK, It's dated, But this short is still fantastic. Some of the later Popeye shorts are bland, But this one is great, Featuring fun jokes, delightful animation and other stuff. Plus, It's complete with orginal \"Paramount Pictures\" logo, instead of the damn AAP logo. Worth downloading!","reviewtitle":"Popeye for President (1956)","reviewer":"N.E.B","reviewdate":"2008-02-26 22:34:01","createdate":"2008-02-26 22:34:01","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Fun.","reviewtitle":"Great","reviewer":"PERCE-NEIGE","reviewdate":"2015-07-06 19:08:29","createdate":"2015-07-06 19:08:29","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"I just just loved this show as a kid \u2764","reviewtitle":"POPEYE THE SAILOR MAN","reviewer":"AdithyaShastry","reviewdate":"2017-02-10 20:00:03","createdate":"2017-02-10 20:00:03","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Childhood well spent","reviewtitle":"Amazing","reviewer":"YorkOrwell","reviewdate":"2017-06-26 07:08:43","createdate":"2017-06-26 07:08:43","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"I used to watch this cartoon all the time as a kid, it brings back lots of memories","reviewtitle":"Pure nostalgia","reviewer":"Agustino Thadeus","reviewer_itemname":"@agustino_thadeus","reviewdate":"2017-11-04 09:20:54","createdate":"2017-11-04 09:20:54","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"One of best cartoons","reviewtitle":"Best","reviewer":"Xhunter333","reviewer_itemname":"@xhunter333","reviewdate":"2017-12-27 23:57:47","createdate":"2017-12-27 23:57:47","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Reminded me of my childhood days !!","reviewtitle":"Very entertaining!!","reviewer":"/|-35HQ","reviewer_itemname":"@testerorg","reviewdate":"2018-10-01 07:06:28","createdate":"2018-10-01 07:06:28","stars":"5"},{"reviewtitle":"Hmmm 2020.","reviewbody":"Wow. If only people had learnt something from the oldies.","stars":"5","reviewer":"Meyah","reviewdate":"2020-11-12 22:04:20","createdate":"2020-11-12 22:04:20","reviewer_itemname":"@meyah"},{"reviewtitle":"Artwork","reviewbody":"It's worth downloading!\nWe will definitely add it to our footage database: https://011.video","stars":"5","reviewer":"011.video","reviewdate":"2021-10-10 00:33:35","createdate":"2021-10-10 00:33:35","reviewer_itemname":"@011_video"},{"reviewtitle":"Popeye for President","reviewbody":"Hilarious, funny and love Popeye films\nThe oldies are the best","stars":"5","reviewer":"Tragiccomic","reviewdate":"2022-08-18 12:12:34","createdate":"2022-08-18 12:12:34","reviewer_itemname":"@tragiccomic"},{"reviewtitle":"Permission","reviewbody":"Please grant me permission to upload this video to my YouTube channel Id is person11@example.invalid I will be very thankful to you ","stars":"5","reviewer":"Anfal381","reviewdate":"2023-01-21 09:57:53","createdate":"2023-01-21 09:57:53","reviewer_itemname":"@anfal381"},{"reviewtitle":"\"Popeye for President\" is such a delightful 1950s classic!","reviewbody":"I love the humor and the playful rivalry between Popeye and Bluto, and Olive Oyl\u2019s vote adds the perfect twist. The animation and Technicolor really bring the characters to life, and the short runtime makes it a fun, bite-sized piece of nostalgia. Timeless and entertaining!\nhttps://dudetheftauto.net","stars":"4","reviewer":"Ryann Walker","reviewdate":"2025-10-13 02:51:49","createdate":"2025-10-13 02:51:49","reviewer_itemname":"@ryann_walker"}],"server":"dn